#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:1 031310e0a5494cbe8cf8c9bffb8be2b5
msgid "CI/CD Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:3 fefcd8abef35447bbc18a05fa4a1c037
msgid ""
"`findfmt` streamlines continuous integration pipelines by providing "
"dynamic, content-aware file discovery. Rather than maintaining brittle, "
"hard-coded file lists across configuration files, CI jobs can locate "
"target files on the fly while respecting `.gitignore` rules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:7 f6330bc3a03b47e8a95d0509df417250
msgid "1. CI/CD Design Principles with `findfmt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:9 5b331d4546b24ab9bd4bdddf6a9e44e6
msgid ""
"When integrating `findfmt` into automated workflows, adhere to the "
"following best practices:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:11 7843678bb8ae4af19400d7713c7340dd
msgid ""
"**Use Pipe-Safe NUL Delimiters (`-0` or `findfmt0`)**: Filesystems may "
"contain files with spaces, hyphens, or special characters. Always pair "
"`-0` with `xargs -0` or `xargs -r -0` to prevent argument splitting and "
"injection issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:14 c2ac0a4f267f44a3bd9c02afcbf5e180
msgid ""
"**Leverage Ephemeral Execution via `uvx`**: Tools can run instantly in CI"
" runners without a separate virtual environment setup step using `uvx "
"findfmt`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ci_integration.md:16 2938e56487144ca292f78587c666d938
msgid ""
"**Mount Workspaces as Read-Only**: When running containerized jobs, mount"
" project directories with `:ro` to ensure discovery operations cannot "
"inadvertently modify source trees."
msgstr ""

